OL,3,GNEWSACordon remains after '250lb WW2
OL,4,Abomb' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cordon remains in place for a second
OL,7,Fday after a suspected unexploded bomb
OL,8,Fwas found in a dock in Cornwall.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FFalmouth Docks at 09:15 BST on Monday
OL,12,Fafter a suspected 250lb (115kg)
OL,13,FAmerican World War Two air-dropped
OL,14,Fdevice was found in the water.
OL,16,FA 300m (984ft) exclusion zone,
OL,17,Finitially including residential homes,
OL,18,Fhas been reduced to cover just the
OL,19,Fdocks and waters around it, but Devon
OL,20,Fand Cornwall Police has since said it
OL,21,Fwas likely "be expanded as work
OL,22,Fprogresses".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
