OL,3,GNEWSACordon remains after '250lb WW2
OL,4,Abomb' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said partner agencies
OL,7,F"continue to assess the unexploded
OL,8,Fordnance", stressing work was "ongoing
OL,9,Fto determine the safest and most
OL,10,Fappropriate course of action".
